NOTE: cosine_sim = 1.0 (not just >0.99) because the reference uses IDENTICAL
quantization + softmax-approx semantics — this is a self-consistency check
that the optimized pipelined DUT matches the obviously-correct unpipelined
reference. A SEPARATE comparison against a float numpy reference (with real
exp-softmax) would yield cos < 1.0 due to the softmax approximation; that
deviation is intentional for v0 and would be measured in a follow-up task.

